        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# A Run Button for Any Job\n\nStarts a pipeline when a person or a caller fires it, instead of a schedule or an external event. Use it as the front of a job you want to run by hand, from a script or from another workflow.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Run button\" is a manual trigger that waits for events. Its data goes to \"2 Payload\", the name of the caller goes to \"3 Source\", and the ISO timestamp goes to \"4 Fired at\".\n\n**Try this:** Set max_events on \"1 Run button\" to 1 so the workflow stops after a single fire instead of waiting for more."
        },
